 learning and community from **June 20 to August 29\, 2026**—all from the
  comfort of your home on Zoom!\n**Zoom Link:** [https://zoom.us/j/58967646
 3](https://zoom.us/j/589676463)\n**Bi-Weekly Friday Zoom Sessions** *(Ever
 y 2nd and 4th Friday)*\n• **4:00 PM** – Advanced Korean with Stephen\n
 • **5:00 PM** – Intermediate Conversational Chinese with Sam\n• **6:
 00 PM** – Bible Study & Meditation Group with Stephen\n• **7:00 PM** 
 – Beginning Chinese with Jane\n**Weekly Saturday Zoom Sessions** (total 
 of 10 sessions)\n• **4:00 PM** – Beginning Spanish with Viviana\n• *
 *5:00 PM** – Beginning to Intermediate Korean with Stephen\n• **6:00 P
 M** – Beginning to Intermediate Japanese with Norio\n• **7:00 PM** –
  English Learners Group with Linda & Chad\n___\n**Important Notes:**\n1. *
 *No Zoom sessions** on **July 3–4\, 2026** (Independence Day) and **Sept
 ember 4–5\, 2026** (Labor Day).\n2. All classes will be conducted **excl
 usively via Zoom** during the summer session.\n3. **Return to In-Person Me
 etings:**\nWe will resume our **regular in-person gatherings on September 
 12\, 2026** at the **2nd floor rooms of Phoenix Hall\, Davis Community Chu
 rch**.\nFor more information about Intercultural Mosaics classes and activ
 ities\, visit [www.nextg.org](http://www.nextg.org/) or contact Dr. Stephe
 n Moon at 916-217-5470\nor email to: [catalyst@nextg.org](mailto:catalyst@
 nextg.org). Thank you!
