 cdavis.edu).\n\n \n\nCo-hosted by the UC Davis Library\, the Jan Shrem and
  Maria Manetti Shrem Museum of Art\, and the College of Letters and Scienc
 e.\n\n \n\nVisit the Letters & Science Magazine Bookshelf to learn more ab
 out books published by faculty in the College.
