DESCRIPTION:October is Archives Month and that means it is time for the Sa
 cramento Archives Crawl! Crawl on over to the California State Library loc
 ation\, stop by our Archives and Special Collections table and meet our ar
 chivists. \n\nWe'll be highlighting items from our new exhibit\, Archives 
 and Special Collections: Our Work\, Our Collections\, Our Impact.\n\nThe A
 rchives Crawl is for all — free to the public. For more information\, vi
 sit sacramentoarchivescrawl.com.
LOCATION:California State Library\, Stanley Mosk Library and Courts Buildi
 ng
URL:https://events.library.ucdavis.edu/event/sacramento-archives-crawl-202
 6
