UID:5dbf40b921d493c4a4085ac07089e4ca@events.yolocountylibrary.org
DESCRIPTION:Join us in celebrating one of the most iconic and influential 
 Mexican/Latinx artists\, Frida Kahlo\, with a Frida Kahlo look-a-like cont
 est\, Frida inspired crafts and a live performance by Cascada de Flores. A
 ll ages welcome!\n\nSchedule:\n\n11:20am-12:00pm Cascada de Flores Perform
 ance\n\n12:00pm-12:20pm Frida Kahlo look-a- like contest \n\n12:20pm-1:00
 pm Frida crafts\n\n\n\nLook-a-Like Contest: Must be present to claim pri
 ze. One winner per age group.  Age groups: 1-12\, 13-17\,and 18+
LOCATION:Blanchard Room\, Small Conference Room\, Mary L Stephens Davis Br
 anch Library
URL:https://events.yolocountylibrary.org/event/16768859
X-SOURCE:Yolo Library
END:VEVENT
