 rings their electrifying live performance to Jackson Hall. Joined by power
 house vocalist Anjelika “Jelly” Joseph\, expect a night of fresh energ
 y\, soulful vocals\, and an expansive\, high-octane sound.\n\nTickets are 
 limited to 20 students. First come\, first serve. A confirmation email wil
 l be sent out during week 2 of the event. You MUST confirm your attendance
  no later than Thursday\, October 15 or you can lose your seat. You are we
 lcomed to bring a friend (Non-GSP student) but please reach out if your fr
 iend is not able to make it so we can distribute tickets for other student
 s. \n\nTickets must be claimed by October 15th.
