  Learn about the many different programs available\, including the Master
 ’s in Social Work (MSW)\, Master’s in Marriage and Family Therapy (MFT
 )\, clinical psychology Ph.Ds and PsyDs\, and research Ph.Ds. Find out whi
 ch grad programs prepare you for specific career paths\, including therapi
 st\, clinical psychologist\, or professor of psychology\, and how to prepa
 re for them.
